# Resume versioning

- Quality baseline is `resumes/base/JZ_resume.tex`. Do not dilute specificity.
- One active resume. `JZ_resume` at `resumes/base/JZ_resume.tex` and `resumes/base/JZ_resume.pdf`.
- `role_cluster` / `resume_cluster` are job taxonomy only (`cloud_swe` | `data_ml` | `health_ai`).
- Prefer the Simplify resume already attached. Disk fallback is `resumes/base/JZ_resume.pdf` only.
- Historical `resume_version` strings on applied rows stay. Inactive registry rows stay.
- Record exact `resume_version` after every apply.
- Broad: approved base resume. Core: light tailor. Deep tailor rare.
- Every version change needs a hypothesis in `data/resume_versions.csv`.
